      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "とはいえ、ちと心配じゃのう。\r\n時間ができた時に、アヤカの様子を\r\n見に行ってみようかの。",
        "official_en": "Though I must admit, I am somewhat concerned. Let us pay her a visit when time permits to see how she fares.",
