        "official_en_sha256": "800236cabd78018c196fa63ffa11fc93fad6bedce90b42be1d833fa916730ab4"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "はい、もちろんです！\r\n師匠に言われたことを\r\n私が忘れるわけありません！",
        "official_en": "Of course! I haven’t forgotten for a moment, Mistress!",
        "real_en": "Of course! How could I ever forget\r\nwhat you told me, Master?"
